  - customers/data_request
  - customers/redact
  - shop/redact
" connectable="0" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="260" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#fbbf24;fillColor=#2d2206;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" value="
Circuit Breaker
(okkatiel)
• 5 failures → OPEN
• 30s recovery timeout
• Redis fallback (stale cache)
" connectable="0" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="365" width="300" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#fbbf24;fillColor=#2d2206;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" value="
Cart Flow (Server Action)
1. addToCartAction(cartId, lines)
2. CART_LINES_ADD mutation
3. Redis DEL cart:user:{id}
4. revalidateTag('cart')
5. CartProvider refetch /api/cart
" connectable="0" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="440" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#fbbf24;fillColor=#2d2206;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" value="
Webhook Flow
1. POST /api/webhooks
2. HMAC-SHA256 validate
3. Idempotency check (Redis)
4. processWebhook(topic, payload)
5. revoke tokens / revalidate cache
" connectable="0" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="545" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
